# Hostinger MCP

This project is the LBOR Hostinger account. Hosting, DNS, domains, WordPress, and other Hostinger API work goes through the project server `hostinger-lbor`, defined in `.cursor/mcp.json`.

- Call tools on `hostinger-lbor` only.
- Do not call `hostinger-dda`, `user-hostinger`, or any other Hostinger MCP for this repo.
- If `hostinger-lbor` is not connected, stop and say so. Do not fall back to another Hostinger account.
